# Case: Search and copy real history through the native desktop
# Mode: native
# Purpose: Connect visible user actions to production history and clipboard application.
# Steps:
#   Start an isolated desktop, submit two text entries, search for one, copy it, then clear the search.
# Expected:
#   Only the matching entry remains; copying writes exact directory-clipboard bytes; clearing restores both entries.
# Forbidden:
#   Fixture rows, system clipboard writes, missing screenshots or missing continuous recording.

start
submit selected 'Desktop evidence selected needle'
submit other 'Desktop evidence other entry'
ui-wait listItem 'Desktop evidence selected needle'
ui-wait listItem 'Desktop evidence other entry'
screenshot history
ui-click button '搜索历史'
ui-wait comboBox '搜索历史'
ui-set comboBox '搜索历史' needle
ui-wait listItem '~.*selected needle$'
ui-absent listItem 'Desktop evidence other entry'
screenshot filtered
ui-click listItem '~.*selected needle$'
ui-key Enter
board-equals 'Desktop evidence selected needle'
screenshot copied
ui-set comboBox '搜索历史' ''
ui-wait listItem 'Desktop evidence other entry'
screenshot restored
